    "The business model relies on a low fixed-cost base, with administrative expenses remaining low relative to turnover.",
    "Adjusted EBITDA (including addbacks for director pension and salary) reached a peak of £258.7k in YE25, showing high cash-generative potential.",
    "The company maintains a lean structure with a sole employee and a flexible subcontracted associate model, supporting scalability.",
    "Significant margin volatility is noted between YE23 (66%) and YE24 (40%), likely due to the project-based nature of the consultancy work.",
    "The business shows strong financial resilience with no reported interest-bearing debt and a healthy net asset position of £214k."
